{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56212","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 五十二 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 五十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乙卯中，四海并交通。\n无殃皆得熟，田父美施功。\n粟麦最爲首，偏益在山东。\n其年多有福，嵗内足狂风。\n种植宜须早，高处莫施功。\n中低耕最好，高处出蒿蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}